        :rulingText """Unlike some other dual lands, Turbulent Crater has two basic land types. It's not basic, so effects that search for basic lands can't find it, but it does have the appropriate land types for effects such as that of Dragonskull Summit ("This land enters tapped unless you control a Swamp or a Mountain.")."""@en ] ,
